Author:     Magnus Melin <mkmelin+mozilla@iki.fi>
AuthorDate: Sun Dec 7 10:09:33 2025 +0000
Commit:     Magnus Melin <mkmelin+mozilla@iki.fi>
CommitDate: Sun Dec 7 10:09:33 2025 +0000

    Bug 460075 - part1: remove usage of cal.LOG and cal.LOGVerbose. r=tobyp

    ```
    grep --exclude-dir={.hg,rust,suite} -rlE 'cal\.LOGverbose' calendar/  | xargs sed -i -E 's#cal.LOGverbose#lazy.log.debug#g'
    grep --exclude-dir={.hg,rust,suite} -rlE 'cal\.LOG' calendar/  | xargs sed -i -E 's#cal.LOG#lazy.log.debug#g'
    ```

    For modules, add their own loggers.
    For pure .js files, remove logging.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D274340

